apiVersion: kpt.dev/v1
kind: Kptfile
metadata:
  name: multus
  annotations:
    config.kubernetes.io/local-config: "true"
info:
  description: |
    Multus thick CNI (NetworkAttachmentDefinition CRD + kube-multus-ds DaemonSet + RBAC/config),
    delivered the pure-Nephio way — a blueprint fanned out per cluster by the EdgeSite controller and
    Config-Synced onto the cluster (the same way real Nephio's workload-cluster bundle ships pv-multus).
    Multus delegates to the cluster's primary CNI (CK8s Cilium) and adds the UPF's N3/N6 secondary
    interfaces. Cluster infra, so it's delivered exactly once per cluster (named by the deploy repo),
    NOT installed from the Makefile.
